1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,200
I asked AI to attack math
I barely understand.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,400
It chose Navier–Stokes:
can smooth fluid become infinitely rough?

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,900
They already model weather,
flight, and blood flow.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,500
The million-dollar question:
can the mathematics break?

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,300
AI wrote C++, searched counterexamples,
read failures, and designed lemmas.

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,000
Cheap gates could save weeks.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,200
In thirty-three hours, sixteen routes failed;
L4 remains open.

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,500
Laptop estimate:
one to three days.

9
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,600
Ten cluster nodes could make independent sweeps
up to ten times faster—not proof.

10
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,700
Publication. Two years.
Acceptance. Clay review.
